# Generated per tree by shot_manifests.sh: absolute paths to whatever checkout
# they were made for, so they are a function of a machine and not of a commit.
manifests/
# One run directory per shot: the log, the save, the bmp, and the prefs copy
# each run gets so the client's write-back cannot leak into the next shot.
runs/
# One prefs ini per shot, written by plugin_ini.sh from the plugin id in
# jobs/*.txt. Sixty near-identical twenty-section files that are a function of
# the jobs file, not of a commit; the jobs file is the record worth keeping.
ini/
